## 3. UI Localized String Consumption & Plurals

Consuming localized strings safely in composable UI components with parameter injection.

<Tabs>
  <TabItem label="Android (Compose)">

```kotlin
// File: feature/profile/ui/GreetingHeader.kt
package com.enterprise.mobile.feature.profile.ui

import androidx.compose.material3.Text
import androidx.compose.runtime.Composable
import androidx.compose.ui.res.pluralStringResource
import androidx.compose.ui.res.stringResource
import com.enterprise.mobile.R

@Composable
fun GreetingHeader(name: String, unreadCount: Int) {
    val greeting = stringResource(id = R.string.user_greeting, name)
    val notifications = pluralStringResource(
        id = R.plurals.notification_count,
        count = unreadCount,
        unreadCount
    )

    Text(text = "$greeting\n$notifications")
}
```

  </TabItem>
  <TabItem label="iOS (SwiftUI)">

```swift
