      <div style="font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); line-height: 1.5;">Never join strings like <code>"Hello " + name</code>. Use parameter format strings (<code>%1$s</code> or <code>{{name}}</code>).</div>
    </div>
    <div style="background: var(--sl-color-bg-nav); border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px;">
      <div style="font-weight: 700; color: #ef4444; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">3. Native Plural Handling</div>
      <div style="font-size: 0.86rem; color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); line-height: 1.5;">Do not use <code>if (count > 1) "s"</code> logic. Use native platform plural rules for multi-language accuracy.</div>
    </div>
